  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of <math><mn>7</mn></math> digit numbers whose sum of the digits is equal to&nbsp;<math><mn>10</mn></math> and which is formed by using the digits <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mn>3</mn></math> only is <math><mi>K</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1.23",
  "solution": {
    "text": "In a <math><mn>7</mn></math> digits number formed by using <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mn>3</mn></math> suppose that <math><mn>1</mn></math> appears <math><mi>x</mi></math> times, <math><mn>2</mn></math> appears <math><mi>y</mi></math> times and <math><mn>3</mn></math> appears <math><mi>z</mi></math> times. Then <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Therefore, the total number is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>77</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>77</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>77</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.23</mn></math><br />"
  }
}